  "modules": [
    {
      "textRaw": "SQLite",
      "name": "sqlite",
      "desc": "<p><code>sqlite</code> 模块用于在脚本中打开和操作 SQLite 数据库文件.</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>源码依据: <code>runtime/api/augment/sqlite/SQLite.kt</code>, <code>runtime/api/SQLite.kt</code>, <code>core/database/Database.java</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">sqlite</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
      "modules": [
        {
          "textRaw": "[@] sqlite",
          "name": "[@]_sqlite",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "sqlite(databaseFilePath, options?, callback?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "sqlite",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<p><code>sqlite(...)</code> 与 <a href=\"#m-open\">sqlite.open(...)</a> 等价.</p>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "databaseFilePath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[@] sqlite"
        },
        {
          "textRaw": "[m] open",
          "name": "[m]_open",
          "methods": [
            {
              "textRaw": "open(databaseFilePath, options?, callback?)",
              "type": "method",
              "name": "open",
              "desc": "<p><strong><code>6.6.0</code></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>databaseFilePath</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#string\">string</a> } - 数据库文件路径, 不可为空</li>\n<li><strong>[ options ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li><strong>version</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#number\">number</a> } - 数据库版本, 默认 <code>1</code></li>\n<li><strong>readOnly</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#boolean\">boolean</a> } - 是否以只读方式打开, 默认 <code>false</code></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}}</li>\n<li><strong>[ callback ]</strong> {{<ul>\n<li><strong>onCreate(database)</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>onOpen(database)</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>onUpgrade(database, oldVersion, newVersion)</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> }</li>\n<li><strong>onCorruption(db)</strong> { <a href=\"dataTypes#function\">function</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li>}}</li>\n<li><ins><strong>returns</strong></ins> { <a href=\"#database\">Database</a> }</li>\n</ul>\n<p>打开 SQLite 数据库. 路径会经过 AutoJs6 运行时文件路径解析.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"lang-js\">let db = sqlite.open(&#39;./data/demo.db&#39;, {\n    version: 1,\n});\n\ndb.execSQL(&#39;CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS user (id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY, name TEXT)&#39;);\ndb.insert(&#39;user&#39;, { name: &#39;Alice&#39; });\nlet row = db.rawQuery(&#39;SELECT * FROM user WHERE name = ?&#39;, [ &#39;Alice&#39; ]).single();\nconsole.log(row.name);\ndb.close();\n</code></pre>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"font: bold 2em sans-serif; color: #FF7043\">Database</p>\n\n<hr>\n",
              "signatures": [
                {
                  "params": [
                    {
                      "name": "databaseFilePath"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "options?"
                    },
                    {
                      "name": "callback?"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          ],
          "type": "module",
          "displayName": "[m] open"
        },
